):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(r(t)) & =(2(\\ln{\\left(t \\right)})+(e^{t})^{2})\\,i+2(\\ln{\\left(t \\right)})(e^{t})\\,j \\\\  & =(e^{2 t} + 2 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)})\\,i+2 e^{t} \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the derivative of $r(t),$ which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\ln{\\left(t \\right)})\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(e^{t})\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{t}\\,i+e^{t}\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(t))] & =∇f(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =((e^{2 t} + 2 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)})\\,i+2 e^{t} \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}\\,j)\\cdot (\\frac{1}{t}\\,i+e^{t}\\,j) \\\\  & =((e^{2 t} + 2 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}))\\left(\\frac{1}{t}\\right)+(2 e^{t} \\ln{\\left(t \\right)})(e^{t}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}}{t}+\\frac{e^{2 t}}{t}+2 e^{2 t} \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} \\\\  & =2 e^{2 t} \\ln{\\left(t \\right)} + \\frac{e^{2 t}}{t} + \\frac{2 \\ln{\\left(t \\right)}}{t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186536146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "23479d6b-0017-5db5-a587-dd7c374c7ee8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{16 e^{4 t} \\sin^{2}{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{16 e^{8 t} \\sin^{4}{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536112} {:answer/id #uuid "530366db-79a8-50df-ad45-b44ecc227b13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{8 \\left(- 2 \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 5 \\cos{\\left(5 t \\right)}\\right) e^{4 t} \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{16 e^{8 t} \\sin^{4}{\\left(5 t \\right)} + 1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186536127} {:answer/id #uuid "6bcda1e6-11d8-59b8-b27c-b1988618d72c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\left(2 e^{4 t} + \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}\\right) \\sin{\\